      "text": "Btw",
      "quote": {
        "author": "elonmusk",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103567689515954176/aR-Kjpp4_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-17 15:12:41",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-17T07:12:41.000Z",
        "id": "2111354696854114702",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Elon Musk",
        "text": "@Scobleizer True. \n\nYou will be able to ask the Roadster to perform any of the tricks shown autonomously, as it will be sentient. \n\nAlso, we will have a wild looping track (crazier even than Hot Wheels) at our Texas HQ where you can test out your Roadster.",
