    {
      "id": "2111341265442726210",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-17T06:19:19.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-17 14:19:19",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Just remember.\n\nYou aren’t actually driving the Roadster at all.\n\nYou are driving a computer and it is telling another computer how to drive the car.\n\nIt is steer by wire. Brake by wire. Accelerate by wire.\n\nBut you will think it is better to drive than any other.\n\nIsn’t that a mind f###?\n\nOh and it is SI, formerly known as AI.\n\nI am very emotional tonight. Am thinking about why.\n\nWill write that on the way to the @TheHumanoidHub conference in the morning.\n\nMissed today, had too much to do.\n\nBut it goes back to the Tesla owners at the @theXtakeover last week. Several Cybertruck owners told me about getting flipped off in several places in America.\n\nThis makes all the shit that I took for years worth it.\n\nI am writing this to you from my 2018 Tesla.\n\nElon thank you for making our dreams far more interesting tonight.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-16 10:06:38",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-16T02:06:38.000Z",
        "id": "2110915288296575280",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2110914517546991616/img/-aEGQRS-2MCLlcPX.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 1277.4,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2110914517546991616/img/-aEGQRS-2MCLlcPX.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2110914517546991616/vid/avc1/1828x1080/q-wEytVt_fjHPQj5.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1828
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "Here’s the full Tesla Roadster unveiling event.\n\n0:15 – Crazy Tesla + SpaceX collab preview 2:25 – Last manually driven Tesla car 2:53 – Taking it way past the limits 3:15 – Countdown & first flight works 5:38 – Flying cars are real 5:41 – Peter Thiel flying cars quote 6:02 – Fan suction system (up to 2G) 6:16 – Downforce & crushing track records 7:08 – Starman appearance 7:52 – Rocket thrusters & full gymnastics 8:52 – Kickflip demo (Tony Hawk approved) 9:32 – Real road car + rocket car future 9:56 – Air tanks, nozzles & specs 10:14 – Rechargeable ultra-high pressure air 10:36 – Car reveal & aerospace design 12:50 – Fan modes  13:37 – Variable pitch rear wing 13:50 – 0-60 goal under 1 second 14:21 – Acceleration demo 16:22 – 0.81s 0-60 achieved 16:26 – Production car will be even quicker 17:05 – World’s quickest production car 17:28 – Top speed & Snake River Canyon teaser 18:26 – Mach 0.5+ goal 18:52 – First best flying car + last best driver’s car 19:04 – Production starts 2028",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2110915288296575280",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "Scobleizer",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1915614118876504066/zVnfpAMf_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-16 13:19:41",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-16T05:19:41.000Z",
        "id": "2110963869845959101",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Robert Scoble",
        "text": "Just remember.\n\nYou aren’t actually driving the Roadster at all.\n\nYou are driving a computer and it is telling another computer how to drive the car.\n\nIt is steer by wire. Brake by wire. Accelerate by wire.\n\nBut you will think it is better to drive than any other.\n\nIsn’t that a mind f###?\n\nOh and it is SI, formerly known as AI.\n\nI am very emotional tonight. Am thinking about why.\n\nWill write that on the way to the @TheHumanoidHub conference in the morning.\n\nMissed today, had too much to do.\n\nBut it goes back to the Tesla owners at the @theXtakeover last week. Several Cybertruck owners told me about getting flipped off in several places in America.\n\nThis makes all the shit that I took for years worth it.\n\nI am writing this to you from my 2018 Tesla.\n\nElon thank you for making our dreams far more interesting tonight.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Scobleizer/status/2110963869845959101",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
