      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "What happens when headlines replace hard facts? \n\n\"𝗧𝗿𝘂𝘁𝗵 𝗨𝗻𝗱𝗲𝗿 𝗙𝗶𝗿𝗲\" explores how Charlie Kirk was framed—and what it reveals about narrative warfare and the future of free speech. \n\nWatch the full documentary now on The Epoch Times.👇",
